        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS}"
      },
      "description": "Normalised by system_cpu_logical_count. OTel hostmetrics has no per-core 'cpu' label, so node_exporter's count(count by(cpu)(...)) idiom returns 1 here and must not be used.",
